The '''Sven Alpha''' is a [[Mob]] and {{MobCategory|Slayer Miniboss}} that can be spawned during [[Sven Packmaster]] {{SlayerTier|IV}} Quests. 

== Spawning ==
'''Sven Alphas''' spawn rarely during [[Sven Packmaster]] {{Stier|IV}} quests when the player kills a Wolf-type mob. When this happens, an explosion effect takes place and the Sven Alpha spawns.

