== Behavior ==
The '''Sven Alpha''' seeks out and attacks nearby players. It moves more slowly than its cousin the [[Pack Enforcer]], and tends to stay within close proximity of its spawning location. If it wanders outside that radius, it will become docile, ceasing to attack players. It has {{Hp|480k}} and deals {{Stat|dmg|2,200}} per hit.

If it has not been defeated after a while, it will despawn.

== Strategy ==
*Players can choose to fight the miniboss in a body of water as, like the Sven Packmaster and the other wolves, it is slowed down and players can control the damage that it deals to them.

== Trivia ==
*The Sven Alpha does more {{stat|dmg}} than the [[Sven Packmaster]] itself unless the latter lands a critical hit.
*The Sven Alpha's name is from PewDiePie's Minecraft dog, named Sven. The Alpha part comes from the concept of Alpha Wolves.

